{"id":"002c574215686062","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory.md","title":"Effectively Axiomatized Theory","display":"df-effectively-axiomatized-theory — Effectively Axiomatized Theory","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory","aliases":["90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory"],"display":"df-effectively-axiomatized-theory — Effectively Axiomatized Theory","depends_on":["[[90-df-sentence]]","[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","[[88-df-ce-set]]","[[90-df-predicate-logic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-effectively-axiomatized-theory — Effectively Axiomatized Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为具有固定有效表示的算术签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GN}\">\\(\\mathrm{GN}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 是句子公理集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}(T)=T\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}(T)=T\\)</span>，推理规则固定为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_T=\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathrm{FOL}}\">\\(\\mathcal R_T=\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathrm{FOL}}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a> 的可枚举集合谓词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REAx}\">\\(\\mathrm{REAx}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\nT\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\land\\mathrm{CE}(g[T])\\land\n\\exists d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\\n\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\nT\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\land\\mathrm{CE}(g[T])\\land\n\\exists d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\\n\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原谓词的语言、编码及理论参数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 是公理集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\operatorname{Ax}(T),\\mathcal R_T)\">\\((\\operatorname{Ax}(T),\\mathcal R_T)\\)</span> 是它的呈示，不再将同一变量既当句子集又当二元组。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REAx}\">\\(\\mathrm{REAx}\\)</span> 不声称公理码集可判定；仅可枚举的公理通过携带有限计算证书的证明代码处理。固定规则的有效性已经在谓词逻辑文件中给出，不额外假定任意规则系统都有效。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"714deb184f73887a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b86b211a75cf1748","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"b283fc95a9b1376d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b86b211a75cf1748","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ 为具有固定有效表示的算术签名，$g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{GN}$ 见 [[90-df-godel-numbering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T$ 是句子公理集，$\\operatorname{Ax}(T)=T$，推理规则固定为 [[90-df-predicate-logic]] 的 $\\mathcal R_T=\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathrm{FOL}}$；$\\mathrm{CE}$ 取 [[88-df-ce-set]] 的可枚举集合谓词。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"b283fc95a9b1376d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T$ 是句子公理集，$\\operatorname{Ax}(T)=T$，推理规则固定为 [[90-df-predicate-logic]] 的 $\\mathcal R_T=\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathrm{FOL}}$；$\\mathrm{CE}$ 取 [[88-df-ce-set]] 的可枚举集合谓词。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GN}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ax}(T)=T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_T=\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathrm{FOL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{REAx}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\nT\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\land\\mathrm{CE}(g[T])\\land\n\\exists d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\\n\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d).","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"(\\operatorname{Ax}(T),\\mathcal R_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{REAx}","display":false}],"bytes":1665,"backlinks":[{"id":"e3ae8bc1f7b51728","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}$ (effective-axiomatizability predicate, see [[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory]])"},{"id":"9f8586e4baa616ce","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7eb380164954dfb8","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}$ (effective-axiomatizability predicate, see [[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory]])"},{"id":"1d678518961d4d19","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}$ (effective-axiomatizability predicate, see [[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory]])"},{"id":"d79ded08ce925b1e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}$ (effective-axiomatizability predicate, see [[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory]])"},{"id":"f93e